        "title": "Add starter pill constants, web designer role, and starter funnel",
        "summary": "The common package introduces `freebuff-starters.ts` defining 19 starter prompts mapped to onboarding roles via `FREEBUFF_ROLE_STARTERS`, with helpers `starterForId`, `startersForRole`, and `roleStartingMode`. A `web_designer` option is added to the role question in `freebuff-onboarding.ts`, expanding the active choices to seven. The product funnel schema gains a `starter` stage and four optional properties (`starter_id`, `starter_ids`, `starter_role`, `workspace_mode`) to track when these pills are shown or clicked in the workspace.",
